config BR2_PACKAGE_RESTIC
	bool "restic"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_GO_TARGET_ARCH_SUPPORTS
	help
	  Encrypted, deduplicated backups to a local disk, SFTP, S3
	  (and Backblaze B2 through its S3 API) or a REST server: the
	  engine under pengyos-backup. Buildroot 2026.08 does not ship
	  it.

	  https://restic.net
